      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Paste a correlation ID (from the `X-Correlation-ID` header, a problem+json body or a log line) into **Correlation ID** above to see its log lines below. Each line has a **Trace** link to the full trace in Tempo. Or open *Explore \u2192 Tempo* and search `{ span.pbp.correlation_id = \"COR-PAY-\u2026\" }`."
